WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.640
"No!" Morb howled, lunging toward the pieces of the broken jawbone.

2
00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:10.045
"Get him!" Vig shouted, raising his sword.

3
00:00:10.046 --> 00:00:14.171
A blast of energy shot out of it, but Morb dodged the blast.

4
00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:18.908
Morb snarled, looking around for somewhere to run. But he was surrounded.

5
00:00:18.909 --> 00:00:25.166
He rubbed his hands together, using his last bit of magic to levitate to a second-story balcony.

6
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:28.019
"Stop him!" the king shouted.

7
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:34.733
"Quick—get a Shield spell up around the palace!" another Red added.

8
00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:41.260
Perda, Darb, and Gliss sprinted over to Zann. "Wow, you were great!" Perda exclaimed.

9
00:00:41.261 --> 00:00:49.170
Zann stared at the balcony where Morb had disappeared, and then at the enormous glowing bubble that had just engulfed the entire palace.

10
00:00:49.171 --> 00:00:53.241
"Morb will never get through that shield," said Boz.

11
00:00:53.242 --> 00:01:01.528
"Morb has no intention of getting through the shield," said Zann, still looking at the balcony. "We need to go after him—now!"

12
00:01:01.529 --> 00:01:04.779
Zann rubbed his hands together. "Levitate!"

13
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:10.946
As Zann rose into the air, Fala, Boz, Teplo, and all of his friends followed him.

14
00:01:10.947 --> 00:01:13.904
In a moment the whole group was on the balcony.

15
00:01:13.905 --> 00:01:17.518
"What do you think Morb is up to, Zann?" Boz asked.

16
00:01:17.519 --> 00:01:22.873
"Just come with me." Zann sprinted down the hall and burst into the storage room.

17
00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:24.740
"Stop!" he shouted.

18
00:01:24.741 --> 00:01:28.659
Morb was there, standing in front of the open wormhole.

19
00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.567
He glanced over his shoulder at Zann and the others.

20
00:01:31.568 --> 00:01:35.008
Boz rubbed his fingers together. "Freeze!'

21
00:01:35.009 --> 00:01:41.711
The spell flew directly at Morb, but before it hit him, it spun out of control and disappeared into the vortex.

22
00:01:41.712 --> 00:01:43.450
Morb laughed.

23
00:01:43.451 --> 00:01:50.383
"Immobilize!" said Fala. Her spell veered into the wormhole too, and Morb laughed again.

24
00:01:50.384 --> 00:01:55.749
"Where do you think you'll go, Morb?" said Boz. "You can't run forever."

25
00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:01.220
Morb glared at Boz for a moment and then looked at the others. His eyes rested on Zann.

26
00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:05.189
"I don't plan to run forever, Boz," warned Morb.

27
00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:09.209
"Magica hasn't seen the last of me!"

28
00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:17.960
With those words Morb stepped into the wormhole and disappeared.

29
00:02:17.961 --> 00:02:24.868
"I've never been so terrified in my entire life!" Gliss exclaimed, peeking through a heavy velvet curtain.

30
00:02:24.869 --> 00:02:30.537
"Really?" said Zann. "After everything we've been through, you're scared of a little crowd?"

31
00:02:30.538 --> 00:02:37.303
"A big crowd," Perda corrected. "I think at least half of Magica is out there!"

32
00:02:37.304 --> 00:02:42.919
It was a few days after Morb had disappeared, and Magica was slowly returning to normal.

33
00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:46.857
Zann and his friends were waiting in a small room beside the ballroom.

34
00:02:46.858 --> 00:02:51.733
They were about to be officially named "Heroes of Magica" by the king and queen.

35
00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:57.791
Darb was sitting on an overstuffed chair patting Zing, who wore a jaunty ribbon around his scaly neck.

36
00:02:57.792 --> 00:03:02.247
The little dragon was so excited that there were singe marks all over the room.

37
00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:05.799
Zann stepped over and repaired a burnt spot on Darb's shirt.

38
00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.491
"Thanks." Darb sounded distracted.

39
00:03:08.492 --> 00:03:10.967
"Are you okay?" Zann asked.

40
00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:15.369
"I guess." Darb shrugged. "Do you think Morb will ever come

41
00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:19.008
back?" Zann sighed. "It's better not to worry about

42
00:03:19.009 --> 00:03:22.886
it. If Morb does return, Magica will be ready for

43
00:03:22.887 --> 00:03:26.534
him." Just then they heard a shout of greeting from the

44
00:03:26.535 --> 00:03:30.076
doorway. Several of the kids' friends from Swamp Bottom rushed into the

45
00:03:30.077 --> 00:03:34.383
room. "You came!" Perda exclaimed, racing over to hug some of

46
00:03:34.384 --> 00:03:37.661
them. "Of course we came!" another kid

47
00:03:37.662 --> 00:03:41.368
exclaimed. "Everyone wants to see you guys get your

48
00:03:41.369 --> 00:03:45.706
reward!" Jev was there too. He walked over to Gliss, smiling

49
00:03:45.707 --> 00:03:49.437
sheepishly. "Hi, Gliss," he said. "I wanted to say I'm

50
00:03:49.438 --> 00:03:52.366
sorry. You know . . . about what I said to you

51
00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:57.236
before." "It's okay, Jev." Gliss smiled back at him. "You did a lot to help

52
00:03:57.237 --> 00:04:02.166
us." Jev looked relieved. "Cool." He grinned and reached for Gliss'

53
00:04:02.167 --> 00:04:06.832
hand. But Darb got there first. He slid his hand into Gliss', and she squeezed

54
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:11.341
it. "Yes, we really appreciate what you did to help us," Darb

55
00:04:11.342 --> 00:04:16.530
said. Jev's face went red as he realized what was happening. "Whatever," he

56
00:04:16.531 --> 00:04:20.007
muttered. Zann grinned. He couldn't blame Jev for being

57
00:04:20.008 --> 00:04:24.957
surprised. Zann hadn't noticed how close Gliss and Darb were getting either. But he was happy for

58
00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:27.597
them. He was still smiling when Perda rushed

59
00:04:27.598 --> 00:04:33.037
over. "Are you ready?" she asked breathlessly, looking prettier than ever in her formal

60
00:04:33.038 --> 00:04:35.085
gown. "It's time for us to go

61
00:04:35.086 --> 00:04:43.539
in!" Moments later Zann, Perda, Gliss, and Darb were marching up a long aisle, with Zing flying joyfully

62
00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:50.127
alongside. The enormous ballroom was filled with a cheering crowd, and even more people spilled into the

63
00:04:50.128 --> 00:04:54.124
courtyard. Colorful puffs of energy popped and sparkled

64
00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:57.677
overhead. The king and queen stood on a dais at the far end of the

65
00:04:57.678 --> 00:05:04.049
room. To their right stood the entire Red Council, and to their left were Boz, Teplo, and

66
00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:09.037
Fala. Zann felt self-conscious but proud as he walked up the long aisle with his

67
00:05:09.038 --> 00:05:17.102
friends. Still, looking at all the faces in the crowd, Zann couldn't help thinking that there were two very important people missing from the

68
00:05:17.103 --> 00:05:21.357
celebration. Were his parents still alive somewhere, trapped between

69
00:05:21.358 --> 00:05:25.661
worlds? What if Morb really was the sole person who knew where they

70
00:05:25.662 --> 00:05:29.705
were? Had Zann given up his one and only chance of finding

71
00:05:29.706 --> 00:05:31.602
them? He dismissed these

72
00:05:31.603 --> 00:05:40.876
thoughts. Morb's offer had tempted him, but Zann had made the only choice he could make—his parents would never have wanted him to sacrifice Magica just to save them.

73
00:05:40.877 --> 00:05:45.156
Reaching into his pocket, Zann touched the stone Wyssa had given him.

74
00:05:45.157 --> 00:05:49.311
His gaze wandered upward, toward the storage room with the wormhole.

75
00:05:49.312 --> 00:05:51.898
He didn't need Morb to find his parents.

76
00:05:51.899 --> 00:05:55.816
He just needed the courage to take a step into that vortex on his own.

77
00:05:55.817 --> 00:06:04.645
The wormhole was still up there—it would always be up there—waiting for him.

